    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding security controls, our company's secure software development life cycle includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider of equivalent CREST level. our company's also have vulnerability management with remediation SLAs based on severity and an incident response plan that includes detection, notification, and remediation, including a 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow. our company's segregation of duties between development and production operations ensures that no single individual has unchecked access to sensitive data or systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, experience, and security controls in place as of 2024, our company's are well-positioned to ensure The solution complies with the client's requirements regarding professional secrecy, GDPR compliance, protection of sensitive data, audit trail completeness, separation of duties, and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, our company's hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU. provides ensures that our company's can maintain the highest level of data protection and sovereignty as required by the client, without introducing any rupture in our company's working methods or undermining our company's anti-money laundering obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance for client and employee personal and financial data, professional secrecy, confidentiality of client data, and respect for auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must not be a decisional support tool and must provide explainability and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All deliverables must be validated by professionals before being produced or signed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, what are the potential legal risks associated with this project, and can our company's ensure compliance with all applicable laws and regulations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company's is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, with up-to-date social and fiscal obligations. our company's have experience with contractual terms such as service levels, penalties, reversibility, audit rights, and confidentiality undertakings, which could be beneficial in navigating the requirements of this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the emphasis on GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, and confidentiality, it's essential to note that our company's is familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy. our company's intellectual property model, which includes proprietary software licensed under a subscription/usage model, may need to be carefully examined to ensure Our intellectual property model, which includes proprietary software licensed under a subscription/usage model aligns with the requirements for explainability and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The requirement for non-decisional support tools and the necessity for professional validation of all deliverables before production or signing aligns with our company's capacity to provide solutions that respect auditor independence and professional secrecy. our company's professional liability insurance coverage of €10,000,000 per claim and general civil liability cover should mitigate some of the risks associated with potential breaches of these requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, ensuring compliance with all applicable laws and regulations, including GDPR, anti-money laundering frameworks, and emerging EU AI Act requirements, will be crucial." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As our company's maintain our company's regulatory compliance through our company's Security & Compliance function, particularly focusing on professional-services deployment contexts, our company's should be well-positioned to address these challenges." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential legal risks include non-compliance with GDPR, breaches of professional secrecy or confidentiality, failure to maintain auditor independence, and inability to provide explainability and traceability as required." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, any dependency on non-European suppliers could pose sovereignty and compliance risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate sovereignty and compliance risks, it's essential to carefully review and negotiate contractual terms, ensure that our company's intellectual property model and data protection practices are fully aligned with the client's requirements and applicable laws, and maintain rigorous compliance with all relevant regulatory frameworks throughout the project duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's experience and legal standing, our company's are generally well-equipped to navigate these challenges, but each aspect of this project will require careful legal scrutiny to ensure full compliance and risk management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget allocated to the project is 220,000 over 3 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain controlled." ;
