    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's financials, active project budgets, daily rates, overhead, cash position, tender eligibility thresholds, and cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024, can our company's propose a cost-effective solution that meets The client budgetary constraints and provides a sustainable business model for our company's? our company's financials indicate an annual revenue of 6,200,000 euros in 2025, with a near break-even result. our company's also have a comfortable cash runway thanks to our company's Series A funding of 12,000,000 euros raised in 2024." ;
