    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the daily rates of our company's personnel, such as project directors, solution architects, data scientists, senior engineers, and engineers, our company's can propose a tailored solution that optimizes costs by allocating the appropriate resources to meet The client requirements while staying within The client budget. our company's cost structure consists of one-off project costs, including framing, design, integration with our company's production tools, change management, and training, as well as recurring run costs like platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The main recurring cost drivers are hosting and inference, which vary based on the hosting tier and model option selected." ;
