    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget envelope for this project allows for a one-off project cost of 40% of the total budget in the first year, with the remaining 60% allocated to recurring run costs over three years. our company's target gross margin range is between 25% and 35%, which our company's aim to achieve by favoring cost-efficient tiers and models that protect our company's gross margin while ensuring predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering these factors, our company's can propose a cost-effective solution that meets the client's budgetary constraints while providing a sustainable business model for our company's. our company's will work with the architect to keep the configuration within the SME envelope while preserving an acceptable margin, ensuring that our company's approach optimizes costs and guarantees the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires an intelligent assistance tool that supports professionals in professionals daily activities, surfaces relevant information, recalls applicable rules, proposes checklists of verifications, flags potential anomalies for human review, and provides explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's design an AI-powered solution that meets these requirements and provides a competitive edge in terms of innovation and efficiency?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Yes, based on our company's company context, our company's can design an AI-powered solution that meets these requirements. our company's Atelier platform, with Our Atelier platform Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, can provide grounded and explainable answers by citing relevant passages from a controlled corpus. provide aligns with the need for surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and providing explainability. our company's RAG approach allows for hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting, which can be leveraged to propose checklists of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The fact that Our Atelier platform can be configured to refrain from producing ungrounded numeric claims and instead flags a missing source, supports the requirement for reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past AI use cases, such as delivering a regulatory-information assistant for a national professional order and a claims-handling assistant for a mutual health insurer, our company's have experience in designing solutions that can meet complex requirements. our company's also have the capability to fine-tune our company's models, which could further enhance performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is crucial to note that any fine-tuning would need to be done with careful consideration of data use terms and compliance. our company's approach to explainability, including features like source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and every interaction logged for a posteriori audit, supports the requirement for transparency and reliability in AI decision-making." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, our company's iterative methodology involving corpus curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loop can help ensure that the solution meets the specific needs of the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of providing a competitive edge, leveraging our company's Sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models via API could offer a balance between performance and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, the choice between these options would depend on the specific requirements of the engagement, considering factors like sovereignty, reliability, and raw performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while there are trade-offs to consider, especially regarding performance versus explainability and the potential need for fine-tuning, our company's capabilities position our company's well to design an innovative and efficient AI-powered solution that meets the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects the proposed solution to have limited environmental footprint, rely on low-carbon infrastructure, and consider environmental considerations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's ensure that the proposed solution aligns with these expectations and contributes to a sustainable future? our company's have an EcoVadis Silver rating, which indicates our company's commitment to corporate social responsibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
