    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While Our company, Faber IA have social commitments such as being a signatory to the responsible tech charter, having gender balance and inclusion objectives, and an apprenticeship and work-study program, social commitments such as being a signatory to the responsible tech charter, having gender balance and inclusion objectives, and an apprenticeship and work-study program contribute to Our company, Faber IA overall sustainability profile but are not directly linked to environmental footprint reduction." ;
