    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, can our company's propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service and meets the client's expectations for a pilot phase operational before the next closing tax campaign? our company's can propose an approach that meets the client's requirements. our company's uses a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, which allows for progressive project conduct with a pilot phase and generalisation. a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure aligns well with the client's expectation of a progressive project." ;
