    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past experience working with regulated and document-intensive organisations, such as a national professional order and a regional council, our company's are confident in our company's ability to ensure strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data. our company's available capacity includes a dedicated team with a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. our company's also have access to change-management and training resources, which can support the client during the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of cost optimisation, our company's partnership with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, allows our company's to offer hosting solutions that meet the client's requirements while controlling costs." ;
