    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's integration partner Ligeo Conseil can facilitate high-quality integration with the client's production tools, reducing potential costs associated with integration. our company's governance practices include a joint steering committee and operational committee, which ensures that the client's expectations are met throughout the project. our company's also have a documented escalation path in case of any issues." ;
