    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's expertise in deploying our company's Atelier platform within regulated environments, such as the public sector, our company's are confident that our company's can meet the client's expectations for a pilot phase operational before the next closing tax campaign. our Atelier platform is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents. forges ensures that all answers provided by the assistant are grounded in cited sources and respect professional secrecy and confidentiality. our company's can work with the client to configure our Atelier platform to meet the client specific needs and ensure a successful pilot phase." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our company's believe our company's has the necessary expertise, experience, and resources to propose an approach that meets the client's requirements and expectations while optimising costs and guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be accessible from the firm's professionals' work environment, support the firm's professionals' daily activities, fit into existing practices without introducing a rupture in working methods, surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications, flag potential anomalies for human review, provide explainability, and ensure reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with cabinet vauclair associ s production tools, electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment, document management system, and payroll software, while having limited environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The hosting must be on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent, without dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our current technology stack, performance benchmarks, sovereign hosting options, technical constraints as of 2024, can our design a solution that meets these requirements and ensures high availability during business hours, resilience to seasonal peak loads, and response times below 2 seconds for common queries? our can design a solution based on our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has components such as document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer that can support the required functionality.  our model options include a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which is fully sovereign, auditable, and has strong grounding/citation behavior, meeting the requirements for explainability and reliability of outputs. our have experience with API design and business tool integration, including connectors and adapters for accounting-production and payroll software, document-management systems, and electronic-invoicing environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable our to integrate our solution with cabinet vauclair associ s production tools, electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment, document management system, and payroll software. our hosting options include a Sovereign tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered, meeting the requirements for limited environmental footprint and sovereign hosting. our can also ensure high availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads by scaling horizontally and sizing capacity for peak loads." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our median latency is 1.3 seconds, and our p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds for common queries, which meets the response time requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, considering our current technology stack, performance benchmarks, sovereign hosting options, and technical constraints as of 2025, our can design a solution that meets the requirements and ensures high availability, resilience to seasonal peak loads, and fast response times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, compliance with GDPR for personal and financial data, protection of sensitive data with encryption and pseudonymisation, a complete audit trail, separation of duties, and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must not introduce any rupture in cabinet vauclair associ s working methods or undermine cabinet vauclair associ s anti-money laundering obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's security certifications, experience with EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act), AI security controls, and audit capabilities as of 2024, can our company's ensure that The solution complies with these requirements and maintains the highest level of data protection and sovereignty? our company's have ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations, indicating our company's commitment to information security. our company's ISO 27701 certification provides an extension for privacy information management, demonstrating our company's ability to handle personal data in accordance with GDPR requirements.  our company's experience with EU regulatory frameworks such as GDPR is reflected in our company's data protection measures, including encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256, key management through EU-based infrastructure, strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, pseudonymisation, and data minimisation. our company's also implement role-based access control (RBAC), audit logging for all system outputs, and have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed. our company's data processing register is maintained, and our company's have a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available that aligns with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

